Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.24,0:01:00.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.55,0:03:20.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,發 發生什麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.09,0:03:22.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這麼大動靜
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.26,0:03:23.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是何人飛升啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.42,0:03:25.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是哪位新貴飛升了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.18,0:03:26.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好大的陣仗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.59,0:03:28.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,平時有人飛升 最多也就震兩下\N我的神宮啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.01,0:03:29.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,平時有人飛升 最多也就震兩下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.35,0:03:30.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但今天這架勢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.85,0:03:32.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天都快震塌了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,想必這飛升之人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.35,0:03:35.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,定是天賦異稟
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.52,0:03:36.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,修為絕佳
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:37.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,吉人天相
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.27,0:03:38.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,運勢驚人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.56,0:03:40.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,了不得 了不得呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.69,0:03:41.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,究竟是何方神聖啊
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.82,0:03:42.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,幾百年前
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.57,0:03:44.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那仙樂太子飛升也是這般
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.86,0:03:46.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,呸呸呸 提他做什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.45,0:03:46.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,晦氣
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.45,0:03:49.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走走走
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.16,0:03:50.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去看看到底是何方神聖
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.83,0:03:52.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.39,0:04:07.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有完沒完
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.84,0:04:08.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼又是他\N還有完沒完
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:09.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼又是他
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.53,0:04:27.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下 恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:29.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一飛升就摘得本甲子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.95,0:04:33.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最盼望將其貶下凡間的神官榜 第一名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.45,0:04:36.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,雖然是個第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.83,0:04:38.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但好像也沒什麼可喜的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.42,0:04:39.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本榜第一
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.63,0:04:40.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可得一百功德
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.84,0:04:43.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,下次評選也請捎上我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.84,0:04:45.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你知道第二名是誰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.59,0:04:46.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太難猜了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.84,0:04:47.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,論實力
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.88,0:04:49.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我一人應可包攬前三甲
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:50.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,差不多了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.93,0:04:51.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒有第二名
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.76,0:04:53.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你一騎絕塵
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.02,0:04:54.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,望塵莫及
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.18,0:04:57.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那上一甲子的榜首是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.10,0:04:59.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.44,0:05:01.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,因為這個榜是從今年
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.56,0:05:02.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,準確來說
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.77,0:05:04.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是從今天才開設的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.78,0:05:05.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.57,0:05:06.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看來我運氣不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.78,0:05:07.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,恰好趕上了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.86,0:05:12.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你知道自己為什麼會奪魁嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.41,0:05:13.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,眾望所歸
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.37,0:05:15.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下 請看那個鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.91,0:05:18.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哪裡有鍾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.00,0:05:20.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒看到就對了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.25,0:05:22.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那裡本來有鍾
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:25.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但你飛升的時候把它震掉了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.17,0:05:26.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還砸了一位路過的神官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.51,0:05:29.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那現在如何了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.22,0:05:31.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還在修
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.76,0:05:33.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是說那位神官
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.18,0:05:34.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被砸的是位武神
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.97,0:05:36.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,反手就把鍾劈了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.14,0:05:39.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再看那邊的金殿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.48,0:05:43.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這次看到了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.06,0:05:44.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看到才不對
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.15,0:05:46.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那裡本來什麼都沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.65,0:05:49.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你飛升的時候震毀了數座金殿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.95,0:05:50.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,來不及修
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.36,0:05:53.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只能臨時搭幾座湊合了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.66,0:05:54.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,責任在我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.12,0:05:55.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.79,0:05:56.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,責任在你
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.95,0:06:00.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是不是剛上來就把很多神官得罪了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:02.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不是不能挽回
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.63,0:06:03.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼挽回
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.63,0:06:06.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好說 八百八十八萬功德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.51,0:06:11.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道 十分之一你都拿不出來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.18,0:06:12.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是萬分之一
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.18,0:06:13.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也拿不出來啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.97,0:06:15.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫慌
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.01,0:06:17.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,車到山前必有路
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:20.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我是船到橋頭自然沉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:21.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我有一計
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.14,0:06:24.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,進通靈陣的口令沒忘吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.15,0:06:26.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:33.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有完沒完
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:36.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,開盤下注買定離手
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.16,0:06:38.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,諸位 都到齊了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.41,0:06:40.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,帝君北方有要務
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.21,0:06:42.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,急需用人
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.92,0:06:46.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知哪位武神殿下\N能從殿裡撥兩名武官過來
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.26,0:06:51.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聽說帝君現下不在北方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.80,0:06:54.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文殿 怕是替誰借人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:55.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.76,0:06:57.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要快速獲取功德
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.35,0:06:58.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是沒有辦法
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.89,0:07:04.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,近來北方有一批大信徒頻頻請願
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.48,0:07:07.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,求天官下凡以平妖鬼之祟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.94,0:07:11.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,目下帝君顧不上北方
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.07,0:07:13.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明光將軍也有事在身
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.53,0:07:16.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若殿下能代為去一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.24,0:07:18.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,則屆時所獲功德
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.45,0:07:21.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,將盡數奉於你壇上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.83,0:07:24.21,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這不是太子殿下嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.25,0:07:26.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這都多少回了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.00,0:07:26.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒完沒了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.83,0:07:27.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他怎麼又飛升了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.92,0:07:29.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下這是又回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.17,0:07:29.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多少次了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.80,0:07:30.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第三次了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.67,0:07:31.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.17,0:07:32.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我賭他這次撐不了一年
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.97,0:07:33.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一年太長了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.55,0:07:34.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上次他一炷香的時間就下去了\N一年太長了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.59,0:07:35.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上次他一炷香的時間就下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.55,0:07:36.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我賭三天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.22,0:07:42.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,剛才靈文殿說帝君要借人
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.06,0:07:44.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫不是給太子殿下借的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.77,0:07:45.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,肯定是
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.94,0:07:47.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在最缺人的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.06,0:07:48.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是他謝憐了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.27,0:07:48.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,無香火 無宮觀 無信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.86,0:07:49.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三無神官\N無香火 無宮觀 無信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.98,0:07:50.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三界笑柄\N無香火 無宮觀 無信徒
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:51.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,三界笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.69,0:07:55.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你看 我說借不來人吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.20,0:07:59.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大家好 我又回來了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.28,0:08:01.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下這次飛升
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.24,0:08:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,真是好大的陣仗啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.08,0:08:05.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.12,0:08:07.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下是好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.67,0:08:08.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就不太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.17,0:08:10.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下 那個鐘
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.26,0:08:14.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鐘的事我聽說了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.67,0:08:16.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,砸到你真是萬分抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.72,0:08:17.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.59,0:08:19.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,請問 閣下怎麼稱呼
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.64,0:08:23.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這都忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.02,0:08:27.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下 那是玄真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.19,0:08:28.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,玄 玄真
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.60,0:08:29.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他是慕情
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.86,0:08:33.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是誰拆了我的金殿
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.11,0:08:37.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,滾出來
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.53,0:08:39.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你拆的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.82,0:08:40.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.24,0:08:41.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,給我等著
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.16,0:08:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拆你金殿的人就在這兒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.20,0:08:44.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己問唄
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.29,0:08:49.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.33,0:08:50.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對不起啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.79,0:08:52.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.88,0:08:53.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是南陽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.88,0:08:54.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.80,0:08:56.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可他好像沒認出我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.47,0:08:58.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.22,0:08:59.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他只是多在凡間
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.76,0:09:01.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知你又飛升了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.64,0:09:03.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,諸位 非常抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.76,0:09:06.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所有損失我會盡數奉還
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.31,0:09:07.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還望給我一點時間
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.02,0:09:08.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.64,0:09:11.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下 最好是說話算話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.23,0:09:13.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我還有公務在身
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.82,0:09:16.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒其他事的話就先告辭了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.44,0:09:17.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我還有事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.95,0:09:18.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我先撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.24,0:09:18.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,溜了溜了\N我先撤了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.45,0:09:18.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也走了\N溜了溜了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.70,0:09:19.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也走了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.03,0:09:19.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也是
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.08,0:09:26.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.29,0:09:28.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是玄真沒說話
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.91,0:09:30.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,本可以借到人的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.38,0:09:33.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒事 我一個人習慣了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.34,0:09:34.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你需要法寶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.30,0:09:35.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也不用
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.55,0:09:38.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我被貶兩次 法力盡失
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.80,0:09:40.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,到了凡間便用不了法寶
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.97,0:09:41.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.76,0:09:43.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此事關係重大
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.47,0:09:46.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還請殿下務必謹慎行事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.14,0:09:49.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若遇難處 可隨時聯繫
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.19,0:09:52.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文殿會盡全力支持
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.98,0:09:55.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,任務詳情在此
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.65,0:09:57.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.99,0:09:59.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可還有疑問
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.61,0:10:02.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文 這次謝謝你了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.87,0:10:06.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我只負責辦事
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.95,0:10:09.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要謝便等帝君回來
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.71,0:10:10.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你親自謝他
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:11.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.88,0:10:20.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那便預祝殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.63,0:10:22.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此去一帆風順
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.18,0:10:24.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天官賜福
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.56,0:10:29.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,百無禁忌
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:45.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聽說了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.41,0:10:46.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,與君山上又出事了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.62,0:10:47.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.12,0:10:48.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又失蹤一個
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.12,0:10:48.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不是嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.62,0:10:51.46,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼時候是個頭啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.04,0:10:53.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,又一個姑娘遭殃了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.93,0:11:04.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,客官裡邊請
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:06.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,您請坐
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.06,0:11:14.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一壺茶 謝謝
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.73,0:11:15.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誒
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.11,0:11:16.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,請問
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.11,0:11:18.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,近來附近可有什麼怪事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.44,0:11:19.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.11,0:11:22.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,非禮勿言 非禮勿言
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:41.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.55,0:11:43.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.63,0:11:45.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,殿下 好消息
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.72,0:11:49.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中天庭有兩位小神官
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.76,0:11:51.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,願來助你一臂之力
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.85,0:11:53.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這會兒人應該到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:55.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小神官
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.48,0:12:01.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.65,0:12:03.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們不像來助我行事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.49,0:12:04.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,更像來取我狗頭
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.11,0:12:06.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你莫不是把人家誑了過來
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.49,0:12:09.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文 靈文
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.13,0:12:24.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,請問 二位是
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:24.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南風
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.17,0:12:25.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,扶搖
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:27.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是問你們名字啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.63,0:12:29.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,多謝二位肯來相助
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:31.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢問二位來自哪位殿下座下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.01,0:12:32.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南陽殿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.97,0:12:33.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,玄真殿
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.69,0:12:39.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所 所以是你們家將軍派你們來的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.44,0:12:41.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我家將軍不知此事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.78,0:12:44.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我家將軍也不知
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.78,0:12:48.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你們 知道我是誰嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.66,0:12:50.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.83,0:12:53.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是人間正道
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是世界中心
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.41,0:12:56.96,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他是不是翻了個白眼
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.66,0:12:58.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是 讓他滾
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:00.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,憑什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.58,0:13:01.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要滾你滾
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.88,0:13:06.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,等一下 等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.17,0:13:08.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們真是自願嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:09.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此事不必勉強
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.43,0:13:13.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 自 願
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.14,0:13:17.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那言歸正傳
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:19.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這與君山附近
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.10,0:13:20.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有一個傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.60,0:13:22.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說山里住著一個詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.73,0:13:23.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,面貌醜陋
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.77,0:13:24.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行蹤詭異
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.07,0:13:26.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,專搶出嫁的新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.57,0:13:28.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,過去近百年間
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.15,0:13:30.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,已有十七名新娘失蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.99,0:13:32.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上百名送親人遇難
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.12,0:13:35.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這事原本傳不到天上
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.20,0:13:37.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但恰恰第十七位新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.08,0:13:39.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,父親是個官老爺
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.12,0:13:41.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,當初風聞此地傳說
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.92,0:13:44.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,精心挑選了四十名勇武絕倫的隨侍
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.05,0:13:46.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,護送愛女成親
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.67,0:13:48.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,偏偏女兒還是沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.63,0:13:49.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那官老爺愛女如命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.34,0:13:51.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,暴怒之下
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.47,0:13:52.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聯合一眾官朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.18,0:13:54.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,傾盡全力祈福請願
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.35,0:13:56.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還重金懸賞詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:13:58.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,搞得整個北方不得安寧
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.35,0:14:01.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這才驚動了上邊的神官
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.15,0:14:03.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們此次的目標
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.81,0:14:05.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便是抓到這詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.82,0:14:07.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,失蹤新娘可有共同之處
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.90,0:14:11.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有窮有富 有美有丑
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:12.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有妻有妾
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.07,0:14:14.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一言蔽之
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.16,0:14:14.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,毫無規律
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.16,0:14:17.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有誰見過這詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.33,0:14:18.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,並無
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.96,0:14:22.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既無人見過
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.17,0:14:23.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你又怎知是詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.50,0:14:24.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不是別的什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.84,0:14:26.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,詭新郎只是一個叫法
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.84,0:14:28.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過你說的有理
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.01,0:14:29.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天色不早了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.26,0:14:32.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先找個落腳地再討論吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.89,0:14:39.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那是
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.35,0:14:45.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有人不怕死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.77,0:14:46.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢來送親
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.45,0:15:01.71,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這些人不對勁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.25,0:15:02.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去看看
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.79,0:15:03.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們快住手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.25,0:15:05.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,快停下來
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.63,0:15:06.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.30,0:15:08.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:12.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘 他們只想用你引出詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.01,0:15:14.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你莫要被騙了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.51,0:15:15.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,讓開
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.85,0:15:21.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是個假的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.43,0:15:23.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.39,0:15:25.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好啊 又是你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.60,0:15:26.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你這臭婆娘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.98,0:15:28.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,總壞老子好事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.65,0:15:31.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要是你肯扮新娘
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.07,0:15:34.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,老子也不會弄塊兒木頭作餌
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.70,0:15:35.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好醜的丫頭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.37,0:15:38.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,扶搖 不能這樣說女孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.16,0:15:40.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那不是小彭頭和小螢姑娘嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.83,0:15:41.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還真是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.66,0:15:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這個小彭頭
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:44.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,成天帶著一群潑皮
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.58,0:15:45.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,整些歪門邪道的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.38,0:15:48.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最近又盯上官老爺的懸賞
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.17,0:15:49.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要抓什麼詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.05,0:15:51.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你們別聽他的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.01,0:15:53.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,與君山那麼危險
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.26,0:15:53.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不要去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.55,0:15:56.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他 他只是想要賞金
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.09,0:15:56.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拿點錢怎麼了\N他 他只是想要賞金
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.55,0:15:57.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,拿點錢怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.55,0:16:00.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大傢伙兒不也順道為民除害了嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.89,0:16:02.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可不 這錢還少了呢
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.06,0:16:04.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但 但這不是在送死嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.19,0:16:06.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之前讓你假扮新娘子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.73,0:16:07.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不肯
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.52,0:16:09.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,現在我們要去抓人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.06,0:16:09.90,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你又來攔路
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.27,0:16:11.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你到底什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.36,0:16:12.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是 你說呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.73,0:16:14.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這麼不想讓人去呀
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.24,0:16:16.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,敢情那詭新郎是你相好啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.11,0:16:17.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你胡說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.66,0:16:19.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你隔三差五就往與君山里跑
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.99,0:16:21.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,大伙都看到了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.79,0:16:22.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就是
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.87,0:16:23.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,老實交代
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:24.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你的相好在哪兒
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.91,0:16:25.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.33,0:16:28.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你們別過來
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.51,0:16:37.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,欺人太甚
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.97,0:16:41.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聽說這詭新郎滿臉繃帶
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.97,0:16:42.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,奇醜無比
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.97,0:16:44.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,跟你還
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.44,0:16:54.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你是什麼人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.03,0:16:57.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.36,0:16:59.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這人使妖法
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.61,0:17:00.49,Dialog,,0,0,0,,給我上
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.59,0:17:18.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:19.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,來呀
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.63,0:17:20.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不打了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.39,0:17:21.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,今天算你贏
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.68,0:17:23.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你別得意 咱們走著瞧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.31,0:17:32.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,柱子記得賠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.98,0:17:33.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.15,0:17:37.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘 可有受傷
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.95,0:17:43.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你 你要幹什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.54,0:17:47.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘 你
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.87,0:17:48.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,流氓
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.25,0:17:53.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你裙子破了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.67,0:17:59.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以以後少管閒事
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.93,0:18:01.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,主動幫忙還被倒打一耙
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:02.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,全天下也只有你了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.18,0:18:04.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,行 帳清了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.51,0:18:05.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.85,0:18:08.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,謝謝掌櫃
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.18,0:18:09.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:11.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知離這最近的明光廟怎麼走
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.40,0:18:13.44,Dialog,,0,0,0,,明光廟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.65,0:18:15.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們這兒沒有明光廟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:17.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.03,0:18:18.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼會
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.49,0:18:20.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不過
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.53,0:18:21.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,倒有一間南陽廟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.95,0:18:24.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,離這兒五里地
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.66,0:18:26.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,出了城右轉就是了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.59,0:18:39.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,奇怪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.51,0:18:41.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,北方明明是明光將軍的地盤
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.72,0:18:43.18,Dialog,,0,0,0,,卻竟然只有南陽廟
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.06,0:18:48.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南陽真君主東南
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.68,0:18:50.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在北方的香火竟也這般旺盛啊
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:51.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.60,0:18:53.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不錯不錯
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.77,0:18:54.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,深受愛戴
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.52,0:18:56.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,但我有個疑問
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.73,0:18:57.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.69,0:18:58.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知當講不當講
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.78,0:18:59.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就不要講
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.61,0:19:02.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其實我想說
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.74,0:19:03.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不知有誰能解答
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.16,0:19:07.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下是不是想問南陽廟的典故
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.41,0:19:08.03,Dialog,,0,0,0,,典故
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.20,0:19:08.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你閉嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.20,0:19:11.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,很久以前
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.58,0:19:14.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南陽將軍曾叫俱陽將軍
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.79,0:19:16.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可那時有個糊塗的國君
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.84,0:19:19.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,錯把俱陽寫成了臣陽
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.26,0:19:22.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,全天下的俱陽廟都改了名
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.22,0:19:26.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就這麼一傳十十傳百
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:29.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,錯字早已修正
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.14,0:19:30.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有什麼用呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.47,0:19:31.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,時至今日
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.85,0:19:34.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,來南陽廟的依然是女客居多吧
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.81,0:19:36.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還一個個含羞帶怯
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.65,0:19:37.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小臉通紅
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.65,0:19:38.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,少陰陽怪氣
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.23,0:19:40.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,閒得慌就掃地去
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.53,0:19:43.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你說什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.61,0:19:44.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.57,0:19:47.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,當年你家將軍不就是給太子殿下端茶送水
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.66,0:19:48.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,掃地鋪床的嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:49.95,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聽你這話說的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.49,0:19:53.62,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還以為南陽殿多為太子殿下打抱不平呢
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.08,0:19:55.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你家將軍倒確實忘恩負義
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.17,0:19:57.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子當年飛升
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.00,0:19:57.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還點了他的將
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.38,0:19:59.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,結果太子被貶
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.59,0:20:01.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他立刻過河拆橋
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.17,0:20:02.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還不許人提這段醜事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:05.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你家將軍也不過五十步笑百步
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.34,0:20:07.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,說是太子侍衛 忠心耿耿
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.43,0:20:09.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最後還不是背信棄義 拋棄主人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.51,0:20:12.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.82,0:20:26.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別吃了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:29.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,落灰了還吃
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.66,0:20:31.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,停下
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.29,0:20:34.91,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第一
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:37.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們口中的太子殿下 正是本人
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.38,0:20:39.38,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我都沒說話
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.79,0:20:41.17,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們就不要把我當刀使
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.38,0:20:42.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,第二
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.38,0:20:44.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,既然你們來協助我
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.88,0:20:46.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我們到底誰聽誰的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.68,0:20:48.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聽你的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.59,0:20:50.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.35,0:20:52.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那我們來辦正事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.64,0:20:53.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰借我點法力
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.97,0:20:54.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我要聯繫靈文
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.31,0:20:57.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你自己的法力呢
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.40,0:20:59.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我的不夠
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.07,0:21:10.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.82,0:21:12.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,北方可還順利
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.03,0:21:15.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,兩位小神官的助力如何
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.87,0:21:17.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還好 各有千秋
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.12,0:21:19.29,Dialog,,0,0,0,,都是可塑之才
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.29,0:21:20.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就好
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.63,0:21:22.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,北方是裴將軍坐鎮之地
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.59,0:21:23.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,香火很旺
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.92,0:21:25.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若是有需要
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.30,0:21:26.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可在他的明光殿落腳
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.34,0:21:28.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們並未找到明光殿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.18,0:21:30.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,便在一間南陽廟歇下了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.14,0:21:32.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒有明光殿
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.55,0:21:33.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這倒是奇了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.76,0:21:34.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,關於詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.22,0:21:36.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還有更多情報嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.89,0:21:40.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,詭新郎的評級出來了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.27,0:21:45.57,Dialog,,0,0,0,,位於惡 厲 凶 絕中的第三等
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.15,0:21:47.19,Dialog,,0,0,0,,僅次於絕
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.03,0:21:49.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,若放任下去
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.49,0:21:50.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,必定危害重大
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.07,0:21:52.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,伏屍千里
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.28,0:21:56.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還請殿下速戰速決
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.96,0:22:01.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這麼久才出個評級
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.79,0:22:03.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文殿效率也太低了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.17,0:22:05.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,詭新郎是凶
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.67,0:22:06.84,Dialog,,0,0,0,,危害不容小覷
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:08.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們要儘快解決
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.67,0:22:10.63,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們有什麼想法
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.97,0:22:13.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,詭新郎既然對新娘子有興趣
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.35,0:22:15.64,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那便用新娘引他出來
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.35,0:22:18.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可假人和障眼法對凶行不通
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.73,0:22:19.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還是得用活人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.35,0:22:22.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,並非所有的新娘都會失蹤
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.60,0:22:23.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,應該還有別的條件
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.23,0:22:25.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,管他的
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.48,0:22:27.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,找個女子來做誘餌
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.82,0:22:28.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,試了再說
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.78,0:22:29.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.61,0:22:30.24,Dialog,,0,0,0,,萬一失手
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.78,0:22:32.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一個弱女子就是死路一條
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.36,0:22:32.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.86,0:22:33.99,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不能找女子
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.20,0:22:35.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你還想找男人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.58,0:22:37.16,Dialog,,0,0,0,,上哪兒找個男人願意扮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.60,0:23:03.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果我是詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.23,0:23:05.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,誰要送這種女人給我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.06,0:23:07.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就滅了那個鎮子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.61,0:23:09.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就殺了這個女人
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.44,0:23:11.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那只能說幸好我不是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.74,0:23:13.61,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公 公子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.70,0:23:16.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.45,0:23:18.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你是昨天那個
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.70,0:23:21.08,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不不 你不要誤會
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.75,0:23:23.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我 我沒有這種愛好
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.87,0:23:25.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,只是為了引出詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.63,0:23:26.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.04,0:23:28.59,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.84,0:23:30.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,昨天真抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.05,0:23:31.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是我誤會你了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:32.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,聽茶攤掌櫃說
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.26,0:23:33.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們在這兒歇腳
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.47,0:23:34.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就帶了些吃的來
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:36.26,Dialog,,0,0,0,,謝謝你們幫我
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.26,0:23:37.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,舉手之勞
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.18,0:23:38.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,姑娘不必在意
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.43,0:23:40.01,Dialog,,0,0,0,,公子
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.47,0:23:42.77,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我會改衣服也會梳妝打扮
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.44,0:23:45.73,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要不 我來幫你扮新娘子吧
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.60,0:23:47.36,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.12,0:23:59.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,情況如何
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.95,0:24:01.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,轎夫花重金聘了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.83,0:24:02.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,而且都是當地人
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.08,0:24:03.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,會些功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.96,0:24:04.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,熟悉道路
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.17,0:24:05.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,能自保
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:08.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子殿下還是多關心自己
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.30,0:24:12.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,他們果然是來搶懸賞的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.17,0:24:14.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小螢這丫頭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.47,0:24:15.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,自己人不幫
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.59,0:24:16.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,偏偏胳膊肘往外拐
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.18,0:24:17.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,對吧 小彭
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.51,0:24:18.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.51,0:24:21.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,螳螂捕蟬 黃雀在後
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.85,0:24:22.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看誰斗得過誰
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.81,0:24:25.02,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走 跟上
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.02,0:24:25.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,走
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.53,0:24:34.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,小姐 高齡出閣
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.20,0:24:36.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,感受如何呀
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.16,0:24:38.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,甚感遺憾
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.49,0:24:40.66,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這送親隊伍里少了很重要的東西
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.33,0:24:42.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,應該都備齊了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.49,0:24:43.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,還少什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.58,0:24:46.83,Dialog,,0,0,0,,兩個陪嫁丫鬟
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.42,0:24:48.12,Dialog,,0,0,0,,哼
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.12,0:24:49.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你就當家中貧窮
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.83,0:24:50.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒錢買丫鬟
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.09,0:24:52.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.25,0:24:54.88,Dialog,,0,0,0,,話說 我們到哪兒了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.42,0:24:56.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,進與君山好一會兒了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.47,0:25:04.27,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.56,0:25:06.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,噓
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.35,0:25:08.56,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們有聽見笑聲嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.27,0:25:11.40,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我沒聽見任何聲音
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.44,0:25:13.15,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我也沒有
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.82,0:25:17.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,故意只讓我一個人聽見
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.82,0:25:21.53,Dialog,,0,0,0,,好 好像有點兒不對勁啊
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.99,0:25:23.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,別停 當作無事發生
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.54,0:25:29.37,Dialog,,0,0,0,,它在唱歌
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.92,0:25:30.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,唱的什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.58,0:25:32.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,淚汪汪
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.84,0:25:33.75,Dialog,,0,0,0,,過山崗
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.30,0:25:35.09,Dialog,,0,0,0,,蓋頭下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.30,0:25:36.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,莫把笑揚
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.51,0:25:37.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼意思
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.84,0:25:38.80,Dialog,,0,0,0,,警告你不要笑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.34,0:25:40.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,也可能是圈套
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.01,0:25:42.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,或許哭了才會出事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.89,0:25:45.10,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不管我是哭是笑
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.47,0:25:46.72,Dialog,,0,0,0,,最壞的結果是什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.77,0:25:48.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被劫走
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.56,0:25:50.31,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒錯
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.94,0:25:52.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有一件事我得告訴你們
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.19,0:25:53.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼事
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.23,0:25:56.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,從上轎起
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.86,0:25:58.07,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我就在笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.16,0:26:11.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,狼 是狼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.54,0:26:12.67,Dialog,,0,0,0,,與君山怎麼會有狼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.27,0:26:28.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,看來是個法陣
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.68,0:26:29.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,得找到陣眼
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.52,0:26:31.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,南風 扶搖
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.60,0:26:32.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們那邊頂得住嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.60,0:26:33.48,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一群畜生
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.73,0:26:34.52,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不在話下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.95,0:26:44.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,鬼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.66,0:26:46.41,Dialog,,0,0,0,,怎麼了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.49,0:26:48.20,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你別出來
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.67,0:26:54.54,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是鄙奴
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.04,0:26:55.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我最恨這東西
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.34,0:26:57.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打起來沒完沒了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.42,0:26:59.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,被它耗光體力
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.63,0:27:00.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我們就玩完了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.09,0:27:06.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,靈文殿沒說有這個嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.97,0:27:10.93,Dialog,,0,0,0,,完全沒提
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.85,0:27:13.81,Dialog,,0,0,0,,來了多少只
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.94,0:27:18.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一百多隻
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.98,0:27:19.78,Dialog,,0,0,0,,可能更多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.44,0:27:21.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,超過十隻就很棘手了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:23.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一百多
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.82,0:27:25.28,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再耗下去就麻煩了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.99,0:27:28.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.79,0:27:30.45,Dialog,,0,0,0,,絞殺
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.59,0:27:47.47,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你不是沒有法力
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.76,0:27:48.85,Dialog,,0,0,0,,用不了法寶嗎
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.76,0:27:50.97,Dialog,,0,0,0,,凡事總有例外
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.77,0:27:53.39,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們先走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.64,0:27:54.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,什麼
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.52,0:27:55.35,Dialog,,0,0,0,,你們圍著轎子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.60,0:27:56.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,就一直會有東西過來
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.11,0:27:57.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,打不完的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.27,0:27:58.94,Dialog,,0,0,0,,先帶人走
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.65,0:28:00.11,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.53,0:28:01.23,Dialog,,0,0,0,,我留下來
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.40,0:28:02.74,Dialog,,0,0,0,,會會那詭新郎
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.36,0:28:04.32,Dialog,,0,0,0,,有空拉拉扯扯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.82,0:28:05.86,Dialog,,0,0,0,,不如先安頓了他們
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.07,0:28:06.82,Dialog,,0,0,0,,再回來幫忙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.70,0:28:11.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,這邊 我們走
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.31,0:29:16.06,Dialog,,0,0,0,,是誰
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.78,0:29:34.33,Dialog,,0,0,0,,中原有古國仙樂
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.20,0:29:36.70,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂有太子謝憐
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.75,0:29:41.13,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子心懷蒼生 一心修行
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.83,0:29:42.79,Dialog,,0,0,0,,其美談
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.50,0:29:45.00,Dialog,,0,0,0,,在民間廣為流傳
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.47,0:29:49.22,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神武大街驚鴻一瞥
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.52,0:30:04.65,Dialog,,0,0,0,,救墜樓小兒於萬民之前
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.66,0:30:19.58,Dialog,,0,0,0,,一念橋頭激然一劍
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.16,0:30:21.92,Dialog,,0,0,0,,斬厲鬼於三問之間
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.04,0:31:07.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,天帝感曰
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.63,0:31:09.42,Dialog,,0,0,0,,此子前途無量非凡
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.63,0:31:12.05,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子年少飛升
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.55,0:31:13.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,位列仙班
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.75,0:31:44.87,Dialog,,0,0,0,,然好景不長
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.33,0:31:46.50,Dialog,,0,0,0,,仙樂國難
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.29,0:31:48.04,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子私自下凡救國無果
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.04,0:31:49.30,Dialog,,0,0,0,,堂堂花冠武神\N太子私自下凡救國無果
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.30,0:31:49.55,Dialog,,0,0,0,,太子私自下凡救國無果
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.67,0:31:50.25,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如今在人間拾荒為生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.25,0:31:51.34,Dialog,,0,0,0,,遭貶凡間\N如今在人間拾荒為生
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.34,0:31:51.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,遭貶凡間
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.26,0:31:54.68,Dialog,,0,0,0,,要我說 風信慕情走得好
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.97,0:31:55.51,Dialog,,0,0,0,,感情深有什麼用
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.51,0:31:56.43,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神官之恥 三界笑柄\N感情深有什麼用
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.43,0:31:57.60,Dialog,,0,0,0,,沒前途啊\N神官之恥 三界笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.60,0:31:57.76,Dialog,,0,0,0,,神官之恥 三界笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.76,0:31:57.89,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之後謝憐又飛升 還不是一炷香就下去了\N神官之恥 三界笑柄
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.89,0:32:01.14,Dialog,,0,0,0,,之後謝憐又飛升 還不是一炷香就下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.31,0:32:47.69,Dialog,,0,0,0,,如果不知為何而活
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.56,0:32:49.98,Dialog,,0,0,0,,那就為我活下去吧
